menu "Board probe"

    config BOARD_PROBE_LINK_TEST
        bool "Transmit the 60-frame link test at the end"
        default y
        help
            Off for an identity pass on a board whose antenna or band is
            not yet confirmed: the probe then never transmits.

    config BOARD_PROBE_START_DELAY_S
        int "Seconds to wait before the first line"
        range 0 30
        default 0
        help
            Gives a USB-Serial-JTAG console time to attach after a reset,
            so the first boot's output (as-found PMU rails) is not lost.

endmenu
